她的胯部，尽情吸食她的爱液。","art":{"background":"a3349","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，哈啊，啊，啊……」","art":{"background":"a3350","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嗯，啊，啊，不、不行，主人……」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨用手压着我的头，浑身一颤。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「刚、刚刚才高潮过，那里很敏感的……」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「要、要再舔本座的小穴的话……啊！」","art":{"background":"a3349","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她一边用可爱的声音呻吟道，一边制止我。","art":{"background":"a3349","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小雨，要休息一下吗？」","art":{"background":"a3349","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「虽、虽然本座也想……」","art":{"background":"a3352","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「但是你已经忍不住了吧？」","art":{"background":"a3352","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她重重地呼吸，悄悄用眼神瞟了一眼我的腿间。","art":{"background":"a3352","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「被你发现了？」","art":{"background":"a3352","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「还用说吗，你都和本座做这种事了」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「要是这都不让你勃起的话，可就是大问题了」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「女孩子家不要把“勃起”这种词挂嘴边吧！」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我听着都觉得羞。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「“自慰”可以说，“勃起”不能说……」","art":{"background":"a3353","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「真是搞不懂主人的标准」","art":{"background":"a3354","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过，只有我们两个人的时候倒是无所谓」","art":{"background":"a3354","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嘿嘿，主人你就放心吧」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「这种话本座只能和你说呀」","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她微笑起来。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"看着这笑容，我的心仿佛被揪紧了。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"真是憋得难受。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我到底喜欢她到了什么地步。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来真不是只是喜欢她的一点半点。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我再也忍不住想要和她交合的冲动。","art":{"background":"a3351","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，本座已经缓过来了……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「已经可以做了……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「可以和本座交合了」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她就像是看透了我的心思，将屁股朝向了我。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，好。我要上了哦」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我将早已进入备战状态的阳具取了出来。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"将其顶端抵在她湿润的花瓣上。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「好、好暖啊，主人……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是我的龟头刚碰上去，她就发出了甜美的声音。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊……主人的那个，马上就……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座都等好久了……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小雨……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"听她这一番话，我的心似乎又被揪紧了几分。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座夜夜都想要和主人这样交合……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「想要被你这样拥抱，这样亲吻，合为一体……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「但是又太过羞人了，根本说不出这种话。而且你每天都很累」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「可事实是……本座天天都在盼望着主人主动索求交合……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「快插进来吧……」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨挺起屁股摇来摇去。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的爱液到现在都还没止住。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是吗，对不起了，没察觉到你的心意」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「今后我们每晚都做吧」","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我开始将阳具向她的穴内顶入。","art":{"background":"a3355","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，哈，嗯，啊！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人的肉棒，嗯，啊！插、插进来了！啊！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈！嗯，啊，啊！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨弓起了背。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这时，她的蜜穴突然收缩，带给了我舒适的压迫感。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"强烈的快感使我身躯一震，赶紧抓紧了她的腰，继续将阳具挺入。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为我想要和她交合得更深。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我坚挺的阳具拨开了她一层又一层的褶皱，向前挺进。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈，嗯，啊，唔，嗯，嗯！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主、主人，主人！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，哈唔，好、好烫啊……」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人滚烫的大肉棒，插到了本座的里边……啊！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，哈，感、感觉就像是一根烙铁棍插进来了一样……！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，哈唔！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨开始主动扭动起了腰。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的龟头被她的穴壁来回按揉，不断刺激。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她蜜穴内的褶皱也开始缠紧。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小、小雨……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「太、太激烈了，嗯唔……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你这样做的话，我……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我会马上就缴枪投降的。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"毕竟我也有一段时间没和她做了。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"积蓄的精液立刻就要被她榨出来了。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊啊！不行，本座根本忍不住！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本、本座的腰，它、它根本不听使唤！一直在抖！一直在动！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈唔，嗯，啊嗯！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，啊，啊！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嗯，啊！主、主人！用力，用力插\n本座的小穴！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「把本座的小穴，插得一团糟……！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"听到她的话，我咬紧了牙关强忍射精的欲望。","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我不断前后运动着腰身。","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"如潮水般的爱液已经化作了润滑油，让我的动作畅通无阻。","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的阳具在她的体内快速地来来回回。","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"醉人的快感和她的体温都引得我浑身连连发颤。","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊嗯，嗯！哈唔！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈，哈，哈。主人，主人！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座的主人……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座等你等了好久啊……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座一定，是为了能与你相遇……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「才、才诞生在这个世界上……！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊啊！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小、小雨！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，唔，呜呜！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的话在我的心中激起了一阵暖流。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们胯部相撞，肉与肉奏响的交响曲回荡在整个神社院内。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这是阳具和阴部剧烈交合的声音。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"男女交欢，心意相通的声音响彻在神圣的神社院内。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈，哈，啊，嗯，啊，啊，啊……！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，主人！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座爱你！最爱你了……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我、我也是！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也爱你！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「所以，和我一起度过余生吧！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我想让你不再责备自己，幸福地活下去！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一边与她交合，一边向她传达我的心意。","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊……","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我终于将这本就不得不说的话……","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"说出口了。","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊嗯！嗯，啊，哈唔，主、主人！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈、哈，本，本座好高兴，好高兴啊！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本、本座知道了……！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座要、变回人……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座要作为人，和主人你度过余生……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「所、所以，嗯，啊，哈唔！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你就、一直、待在、本座身边吧！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座不会、再逞强说、让你回去了！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嗯啊，呀，哈嗯，主人，主人……！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「和本座白头偕老，共度余生吧……」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「求之不得！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们一边交合着，一边许下约定。","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们相约两人一起度过余生。","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊嗯！哈啊哈啊，啊，咕，啊，主、主人的那个……」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「变得、越来越硬越来越烫了……！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊嗯、啊嗯、啊嗯！要、要不行了，嗯！」","art":{"background":"a3356","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「身、身体里好热……！」","art":{"background":"a3359","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊，啊……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨又开始全身颤颤发抖了。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的身体也剧烈地颤抖着。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这是我得以和心爱的少女身心交合而发出的震颤。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小、小雨……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我、我……！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我感觉得到我的睾丸再也无法锁住精液的洪流了。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我没法再忍了。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哈，哈，可、可以哦，主人！」","art":{"background":"a3358","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嗯，啊，哈，哈，啊！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本、本座也，要去……了！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我将整根阳具深深插入了她的密穴内。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨的蜜穴壁包紧了我的龟头和茎身。","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，要、出来了！」","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我要射了……","art":{"background":"a3357","sprites":[]},"chapter":"8-5"}]